Um, you'll probably find this easier if you sacrifice and *don't* pray.
I believe that the hopeful feeling and the reconciliation occur when
you've appeased your god enough to make up for the last time you called
on their aid. If you don't pray for awhile (passed the prayer timeout)
and *then* start sacrificing, you may have better results.

Also, most of the critters on level one are pretty wimpy. "They say the
magnitude of the reward and the magnitude of the sacrifice are
related." (Well, I say that anyway).  If you're chaotic, especially,
see if you can sacrifice a few humans. Great for your luck.


